inability to health and wellbeing, these are the stories that inspire change beyond the race track. Each winning initiative receives global recognition — and a €100,000 donation from Allwyn to help them go further, faster."},"__component":"modules.two-cols-text-module"},{"id":2853,"bg_color":"turquoise-200","fg_color":"teal-600","image_size":"default","image_overlay":"no-overlay","reversed":false,"padding":"both","image":{"id":8847,"documentId":"fmcpwqjdim7x62bkeid8he0s","name":"F12026GP12NED_HZ03200.jpg","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":7087,"height":4724,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/thumbnail_F12026_GP_12_NED_HZ_03200_9c3af18d6a.jpg","etag":"5c9f75afa77244c874792cdad48afae8","hash":"thumbnail_F12026_GP_12_NED_HZ_03200_9c3af18d6a","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_F12026GP12NED_HZ03200.jpg","path":null,"size":8.27,"width":234,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":8269}},"hash":"F12026_GP_12_NED_HZ_03200_9c3af18d6a","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":1967.81,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/F12026_GP_12_NED_HZ_03200_9c3af18d6a.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-21T10:39:30.314Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-21T10:39:30.314Z","publishedAt":"2026-08-21T10:39:30.314Z","focalPoint":null},"title":{"id":11205,"heading":"Our latest winner","minititle":null,"text":"Spieren voor Spieren has been named the Dutch winner of the F1® Allwyn Global Community Award at the 2026 FORMULA 1 HEINEKEN DUTCH GRAND PRIX.\n\nThe full €100,000 donation from Allwyn will support the 2026 Spieren voor Spieren Day on 30 August; an annual event for 600 participants, where children with muscle diseases and their families can safely enjoy sport, play and new experiences.","minititle_url":null,"subheading":null},"__component":"modules.promo-module"},{"id":628,"bg_color":"white","fg_color":"teal-blue-600","title":{"id":5693,"text":null,"align":"center","text_size":"md"},"items":[{"id":1618,"heading":"Support",