ls who've been historically marginalised.","minititle":null,"minititle_url":null},{"id":1005,"heading":"Green Our Planet","text":"This charity teaches Nevada students how to grow food while mastering STEM, nutrition, and sustainability.","minititle":null,"minititle_url":null}],"__component":"modules.banner-cards-module"},{"id":892,"variant":"threeCols","type":null,"title":{"id":5695,"text":null,"align":"center","text_size":null},"items":[{"id":991,"heading":"Nomination","text":"Local Formula 1® race promoter identifies initiatives which have a positive community impact","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":992,"heading":"Submission","text":"Following an eligibility screening, the initiative submits an application form","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":993,"heading":"Shortlisting","text":"Review panel evaluates submissions and selects a shortlist","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":994,"heading":"Judging","text":"Panel selects a winning initiative","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":995,"heading":"Announcement","text":"Winner revealed at the respective race weekend","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":996,"heading":"Celebration","text":"Winner revealed at the respective race weekend","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null}],"__component":"modules.icon-texts-module"},{"id":893,"variant":null,"type":null,"title":{"id":5696,"text":null,"align":"left","text_size":null},"items":[{"id":997,"heading":"Organisation Type","text":"We’re operating in seven highly responsible and growing markets. Our multi-national approach allows us to learn best practices that can be\napplied everywhere and save on costs.","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":998,"heading":"Location","text":"Projects must be making a difference in communities located in a country hosting a participating Formula 1® Grand Prix.","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":999,"heading":"Community Focus","text":"Initiatives should focus on one or more key areas: Empowerment and inclusion; Education and opportunity; Health and wellbeing; Sustainability and innovation — all with a clear benefit to the communities they serve.","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":1000,"heading":"Connection to F1®","text":"There should be a visible connection to the Formula 1® ecosystem — such as ties to local promoters, teams, partner organisations, or affiliated media.","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":1001,"heading":"Impact & Scalability","text":"We’re looking for initiatives that are already delivering meaningful results or have strong potential to grow. Projects with long-term ambitions or the ability to scale their work are especially encouraged.","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null},{"id":1002,"heading":"Transparency & Collaboration","text":"To ensure the award makes a lasting impact, shortlisted organisations should be ready to share progress updates and financial reports — and be open to working with Allwyn, Formula 1®, or local partners to build capacity and amplify their story.","quote_text":null,"name":null,"position":null}],"__component":"modules.icon-texts-module"},{"id":1718,"bg_color":"teal-blue-600","fg_color":"light","title":{"id":11206,"heading":"Got a question or need help?","minititle":null,"text":"For more information about the F1® Allwyn Global Community Award feel free to get in touch by emailing: communityaward@allwyn.com\n\nFor details on how to enter and more details about the award, visit the FAQ page.","minititle_url":null,"subheading":null},"image":null,"image_mobile":null,"__component":"modules.banner-module"},{"id":1717,"bg_color":"white","fg_color":"dark","title":{"id":11200,"heading":"Legal notice","minititle":null,"text":"The F1 logo, FORMULA 1, F1, GRAND PRIX and related marks are trademarks of Formula One Licensing BV, a Formula 1 company. All rights reserved.","minititle_url":null,"subheading"